rk and contribution to Flemish art\", \"Cathedral of Our Lady, which is the largest Gothic church in the Low Countries and admire its north tower. Inside, contemplate an art collection that includes four masterpieces of Paul Peter Rubens. Visit the Baroque pulpit with a wooden sculpture of Pocahontas, and check beautiful stained glasses\", \"The “Het Steen”, a medieval castle located in the city’s ancient port, from where you can admire the Scheldt River and contemplate a sunset next to the water\", \"Leisure (museum, shopping, etc.)\"]','{\"title\": \"Meeting point: Grand Place, in front of the city hall at 9:15. (Look for the white umbrella “Walking Tour\\\")\", \"coordinates\": \"50.8465314,4.3516978999999765\", \"googlePlaceId\": \"ChIJaeKKqIDDw0cRPHsrdUp26hc\"}','EUR',50.00,NULL,'Bravo Discovery',4.84,9,'https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/146/antwerp-day-trip-from-brussels-01.jpg',NULL),('cmh8k54rg00xegsldrw5mtzb0',194,'[{\"id\": 67258, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-01.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 943, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-04.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 950, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-09.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 944, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-03.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 945, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-02.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 946, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-05.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 947, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-06.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 948, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-07.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 949, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-08.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 951, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-10.jpg\"}, {\"id\": 952, \"URL\": \"https://www.freetour.com/images/tours/194/the-old-town-tour-11.jpg\"},